---
import UxCard from "../UxCard.astro";
import Icon from "../icons/Icon.astro";
---

<UxCard
  id="N-04"
  domain="Navigation"
  domainClass="d-n"
  title=`Delay Onboarding<br/>Until Users Need It`
  rule=`<strong>Users skip onboarding they haven't earned yet.</strong> Show guidance at the moment it becomes relevant: not before. Empty states, coach marks, and contextual tooltips teach while users are actually doing the thing.`
>
<div class="fc-6 n04-visual">
<div class="vis-box-bad">
<div class="vis-label-bad"><Icon name="X" size={13} class="ux-icon" /> Front-loaded tutorial</div>
<div class="text-sm-muted-relax">8-screen walkthrough before the user has done anything they need help with.</div>
</div>
<div class="vis-box-good">
<div class="vis-label-good"><Icon name="Check" size={13} class="ux-icon" /> Just-in-time onboarding</div>
<div class="text-sm-muted-relax">Tooltip appears when user first reaches a feature. Context is everything.</div>
</div>
</div>
</UxCard>